%I A323037 #20 Aug 29 2026 22:25:41
%S A323037 0,0,0,1,13,114,849,5842,38174,242737,1511046,9305657,56744829,
%T A323037 344496499,2080941523,12547715281
%N A323037 Number of equivalence classes under rotations and reflections of n-step self-avoiding walks on the 4-dimensional hypercubic lattice that use all four coordinate axes and have no pair of nonconsecutive vertices that are adjacent in the lattice.
%C A323037 In the notation of Nemirovsky et al. (1992), a(n), the n-th term of the current sequence, is equal to p_{n,m}^{(l)} with m = 0 and l = 4. This sequence appears in Table II, p. 1094 in the paper. (We have p_{n,0}^{(2)} = A038746(n) and p_{n,0}^{(3)} = A038748(n).)
%C A323037 Previous name was: Coefficients arising in the enumeration of configurations of linear chains. - _Carlo Corti_, Aug 25 2026
%H A323037 M. E. Fisher and B. J. Hiley, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1731729">Configuration and free energy of a polymer molecule with solvent interaction</a>, J. Chem. Phys., 34 (1961), 1253-1267.
%H A323037 A. M. Nemirovsky, K. F. Freed, T. Ishinabe, and J. F. Douglas, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01049010">Marriage of exact enumeration and 1/d expansion methods: lattice model of dilute polymers</a>, J. Statist. Phys., 67 (1992), 1083-1108; see Eq. 5 (p. 1090).
%F A323037 a(n) = (A034006(n) - 8 - 48*A038746(n) - 192*A038748(n))/384 for n >= 1. - _Carlo Corti_, Aug 25 2026
%Y A323037 Cf. A034006 (d=4, m=0 total), A038726 (d=5, m=0 total), A038746 (companion coefficient p_{n,0}^{(2)}), A038748 (companion coefficient p_{n,0}^{(3)}), A323063 (companion coefficient p_{n,0}^{(5)}).
%K A323037 nonn,walk,more,changed
%O A323037 1,5
%A A323037 _Petros Hadjicostas_, Jan 02 2019
%E A323037 New name and a(12)-a(16) from _Carlo Corti_, Aug 25 2026
